깨달음 level chip (Lv N, TrainingLevel.level) at the portrait's bottom-left; code paints RAIL, ACCENT while a limit break is due (TrainingLevel.awaiting_break). Hidden for pilots without a level."
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(60, 34)
layout_mode = 1
anchors_preset = 5
anchor_left = 0.5
anchor_right = 0.5
offset_left = -82.0
offset_top = 120.0
offset_right = -22.0
offset_bottom = 154.0
mouse_filter = 2
theme_type_variation = &"ProgressFill"

